  "description": "Deterministic, seedable pseudo-random generation for games and simulations: swappable algorithms (xoshiro256**, Xorshift, Combined LCG, Middle-Square-Weyl), reproducible environments, weighted/subset/shuffle selection helpers, coherent noise (value/Perlin, 2D & 3D, fractal/fBm), Poisson-disk and spatial point sampling, and probability/loot tools (weighted bags, loot tables, dice notation, gacha pity).",
